+++ new/README_REV369.txt	2026-09-07 09:33:13.134954374 +0000
@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+TF Analyzer Analyst — REV369 / v1.16.83
+
+REFRESH ACTIVATION PERSISTENCE FIX
+
+REV369 fixes a regression where pressing Refresh / Reset could remove the local per-build activation receipt. When dashboard.html was reloaded immediately afterwards, Device Lock interpreted the same build as a newly loaded build and asked for Email + Token again.
+
+New behavior:
+- A new Load unpacked build still requires manual Email + Token activation once.
+- After that activation succeeds, closing/opening the plugin or reloading dashboard.html does not ask again on the same build.
+- Refresh / Reset clears scanner/dashboard working data but preserves the per-build activation receipt.
+- Explicit license clear/change, true revoke/expired/blocked state, or a genuinely new build can still return to Activation as designed.
+- REV368 strict Update login preflight and REV367 low-usage realtime Remote are retained.
+
+Mobile review:
+- Android production REV352 already preserves its remembered activation key during local cleanup/boot.
+- iOS/Browser REV368 already preserves its remembered activation key during local cleanup/boot.
+- Their Remote Refresh command only asks the PC to reset; therefore the PC-side REV369 fix resolves the observed cross-device Refresh symptom without changing the production APK or PWA activation logic.
